             "envelope's, and the acceptance time is no more than one hour after the entry's "
             'signing start.'),
            ("A matched envelope takes the entry's signing start, which the runtime holds with "
             'the accepted message, in memory only, and never changes.'),
            ('A later eviction of the entry does not remove it.'),
            ('A restart does.'),
            ('Matching never reads `runtime_seq`.'),
            ('An envelope with no bound is still accepted.'),
            ('Its readings are presented as of their reading, as every reading is.'),
            ('**Age, at use.** For a matched message, `age_upper = now − signing_start`, in '
