            ('It is computed each time the age is used or presented, and is never stored and '
             'compared later, because it grows after receipt.'),
            ('A bound displayed in a coarser unit is the smallest whole unit not less than it.'),
            ('A message the runtime holds no signing start for has no bound, including one read '
