            ('While no anchor is active there is none, and a reinstated anchor is active only '
             'once a promotion makes it so.'),
            ('Creating or replacing a pending anchor, for a new manifest or a re-provisioned key, '
             'changes nothing here: under [device-provisioning/v1](../device-provisioning/v1.md) '
